{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54986","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 十 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，田地陡然高。\n必得敌人来土贡（京本作「城土地」），开旗赢彼不疲劳，休士少（川本作「止」、京本作「要止」）枪刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}